{"id":"word:hebrew:H4481","type":"word","title":"מִן","subtitle":"H4481 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"according, after, because, before, by, for, from, × him, × more than, (out) of, part, since, × these, to, upon, when.","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִן (H4481) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: prep.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 116 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִן (min) means according, after, because, before, by, for, from, × him, × more than, (out) of, part, since, × these, to, upon, when. First listed occurrence: Dan 2 5."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִן","transliteration":"min","pronunciation":"min","strong":"H4481","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4481","partOfSpeech":"prep","forms":["מִן","וּ/מִן","מנ/הון","ו/מנ/הון","וּ/מִנִּ/י֮"],"morphs":[["AR",72],["AC/R",8],["AR/Sp2ms",5],["AR/Sp3mp",5],["AC/R/Sp1cs",5],["AR/Sp1cs",4],["AR/Sp3fp",3],["AC/R/Sp3mp",3],["AC/R/Sp3fp",3],["AR/Sp3ms",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"according, after, because, before, by, for, from, × him, × more than, (out) of, part, since, × these, to, upon, when.","usage":"according, after, because, before, by, for, from, × him, × more than, (out) of, part, since, × these, to, upon, when.","full":"H4481. min מִן preposition from, out of, by, by reason of, at, more than (Biblical Hebrew and General Aramaic id. ); — rarely assimilated, as in Hebrew, see Dan 6:5 מִצַּד , Ezra 5:11 ; 6:14 ; suffix מִנָּךְ מִנִּי, 3masculine מִנֵּהּ , feminine מִנַּהּ Dan 2:42 ; 7:24 ; 3 masculine plural מִנְּהוֺן (so Palmyrene Tariff ii. a 34; Nabataean, Egyptian Aramaic מנהם , Cooke No. 89. 6 , S-C Pap. A 10 ) 2:33 (twice in verse); 2:41 (twice in verse); 2:42 (twice in verse) Kt (Qr each time feminine מִנְּהֵן ), 6:3 (twice in verse); &#8212; 1 of place: a. from , Dan 4:10 ; 4:11 ; 4:28 ; 7:4 +, תַּמָּה מִן Ezra 6:6 ; figurative on the side or part of (compare Biblical Hebrew 1c ) Dan 6:5 מַלְכוּתָא מִצַּד . b. out of , Dan 3:15 , 26 ; 5:2 ; 7:3 , etc. c. (coming) from Dan 2:35 , away from , 2:45 ; 4:11 ; 4:22 ; 4:28 ; Jer 10:11 . d. to ask or exact of a person, Dan 2:16 , 49 +; Ezra 7:26 ; to deliver from Dan 6:21 . 2. a. of the source (Biblical Hebrew 2b ), as to be fed from Dan 4:9 ; or author ( ib. d ), טְעֵם שִׂים מִנִּי = by me is a decree made, Dan 3:29 ; 4:3 ( 6:27 מִןקֳֿדָמַי ), Ezra 4:19 +, compare 5:17 ; מִנַּי = on my part Dan 2:5 , 8 (see אַזְדָּא ). b. of the immediate cause, as a result of, by , Dan 4:22 (= ב 4:12 ; 4:20 ), 4:30 ; 5:21 : so with a verb of fearing 5:19 . c. of the remoter cause, by reason of (Biblical Hebrew 2f ), Dan 5:19 מִןרְֿבוּתָא , 7:11 ; so מִןדִּֿי , see דִּי 3. d. of the norm (compare Biblical Hebrew 2g ) = at, according to , Ezra 6:14 יִשׂ אֱלָהּ ׳מִןטַֿעַם at the decree of, etc., 7:23 ; Dan 2:8 מִןיַֿצִּיב according to certainty, 2:47 מִןקְֿשֹׁט . 3 partitively (Biblical Hebrew 3 ), Dan 6:3 מִנְּהוֺן חַד , 7:8 , 16 ; 2:25 ; 5:13 ; (some) of 2:41 מִןנִֿצְבְּתָא ; מִ֗֗֗נְּהוֺן מִנְּהוֺן some . . . others of them 2:33 , 41 , 42 a; so 2:42 b מִ֗֗֗נַּהּ . 4 of time , from , Dan 2:20 ( וְעַד ֗֗֗ מִן ), Ezra 4:15 , 19 ; see also אְדַיִן and דַּי 4 5 in comparisons , different from Dan 7:3 , 7 , 19 , 23 , 24 , beyond, more than 2:30 ; 2:39 ; Daniel 6:30; 7:20 end ; 4:13 יְשַׁנּוֺן מִןאֲֿנָשָׁא לִבְבֵהּ let his heart be changed away from man's (Biblical Hebrew 7b b ; Isa 52:14 ). 6 compounds: — see קֳדָס לְוָת, , [ קַדְמָה ], תְּחוֺת . מְנֵא see מנה . below","rootNote":"(Aramaic) corresponding to 4480","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Dan 2 5","keyReferences":["Dan 2 5","Dan 2 6","Dan 2 8","Dan 2 8","Dan 2 15","Dan 2 16","Dan 2 18","Dan 2 20"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":116,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Dan 2 5","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִנִּ֣/י","source":"he